        "template--15213462618185__e349fe82-4ed8-48b7-b15a-84eb3a247d25-heading-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Our shoes fuel a bigger purpose",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "template--15213462618185__e349fe82-4ed8-48b7-b15a-84eb3a247d25-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We launched Taare with a simple “Buy 1 Give 1” promise – every pair sold meant a pair donated. </p><p>But as we listened to parents, teachers, and community partners, we heard a bigger truth: children’s needs stretch far beyond new shoes. </p><p>Their growth, confidence, and learning sometimes hinge on a sports‑camp fee, a school‑supply kit, or a health checkup. Those conversations reshaped our mission. </p><p>Today we channel a share of every sale into our Kids First Fund, a flexible pool that lets trusted local organizations decide what matters most for the kids they serve – whether that’s footwear, event sponsorships, or urgent essentials. </p><p>Same heart, wider impact.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "aa8f8936-073f-42af-b9ae-2458a23ee7b9",
